        <Document ID="7CE16ADA-5579-4770-9BFB-EE0F0D3F05A3">
            <Text>Lead Angular &amp; Node.js Modernization:
	•	Spearheaded the upgrade of Angular (v14→18) and Node.js (v14→18) for RM Australia’s flagship SaaS platform, Assessment Master, modernising the tech stack for improved speed, scalability, and maintainability.
	•	Redesigned front-end architecture with modular components and best practices, enhancing code reusability, accessibility, and long-term sustainability.
	•	Contributed to system migration from a PHP monolith to a C# .NET Core microservices framework with Azure Functions and API Gateway, enabling event-driven processing and cost-efficient scaling.
	•	Mentored junior developers in Angular and Node.js, strengthening code quality standards and fostering a culture of technical excellence across the team.</Text>
        </Document>
        <Document ID="67A8D707-EA70-453E-B03B-CD799BF2089C">
            <Text>Main Developer – Midas Shoes Migration
	•	Led the migration of the Midas Shoes eCommerce platform from Classic Magento to a Headless CMS + Next.js stack, achieving 40% faster load times and improved SEO rankings.
	•	Engineered integrations between Magento, AWS Lambda, and legacy ERP systems for real-time data synchronisation and scalable performance.
	•	Delivered the platform on time and within scope, enhancing site stability, maintainability, and user experience across all touchpoints.</Text>
        </Document>
        <Document ID="D20AF7FF-CB50-43CD-80E1-FBB34D8008FA">
            <Title>Content</Title>
            <Text>	•	Full-stack e-commerce development: Delivered a high-performance Next.js + React (v19) front end with a headless Adobe Commerce (Magento) platform as part of MFG’s microservices ecosystem. 
	•	Front-end: Implemented scalable state management using Redux, and maintained a customised NPM component library to ensure consistency, accessibility, and efficient development across multiple brands.
	•	Back-end: Developed backend modules, API endpoints, and backend integrations for checkout, orders, and product workflows, while supporting SEO/marketing needs through structured data and optimised product metadata.
	•	Agile Delivery &amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration: Worked closely with designers, product owners, QA, and cloud engineers to deliver features iteratively within agile sprints. Managed tasks, bugs, and release cycles using Jira with a strong focus on value-driven delivery.		
	•	AI-powered product recommendation plugin: Built an AI-assisted shoe recommendation plugin that converted CMS content into vector embeddings, enabling semantic search and personalised shoe suggestions based on occasion, function and customer needs.	
	•	AI-Assisted Engineering Workflow: Leverage AI tools (ChatGPT/Copilot/Claude) to refactor legacy modules, validate design decisions against industry best practices, generate test cases, and optimise implementation patterns—improving development velocity, code quality, and maintainability.</Text>
        </Document>
