        <Document ID="9874144F-51B7-43C4-998B-720B982D5F98">
            <Text>Hi Sitemate Team,
I’m excited to apply for the Full Stack Engineer role. Your focus on autonomy, fast iteration, and greenfield development strongly aligns with how I work.
I have over seven years of full-stack experience across React/Next.js, Angular, Node.js, and cloud environments. Recently at Munro Footwear Group, I delivered several complex integrations—including Australia Post Parcel Collection, Apple Pay Express Checkout, and a major headless Next.js migration—all requiring end-to-end ownership, API design, and close collaboration across product, design, and QA.
Previously at RM PLC, I led the Angular (v14→18) and Node.js modernisation, contributed to the migration to .NET Core microservices, and frequently took ownership in ambiguous, early-stage project conditions.

What draws me most to Sitemate is the chance to work in small, empowered teams, ship impactful features quickly, and collaborate directly with engineering and product leadership. I’d love the opportunity to contribute to Sitemate’s next phase of growth.
Thanks for your time, Ian Qiu
