        <Document ID="D3AEAE89-DFAA-4E0C-8C8D-CAC65FB3A6F6">
            <Title>Content</Title>
            <Text>	•	Full-Stack SaaS Development: Designed and delivered end-to-end solutions across front-end, back-end, and database layers, including API design, data processing, and UI/UX development with optimised PostgreSQL queries for performance and scalability.
	•	Stakeholder communication: Collaborated with non-technical international stakeholders to turn high-level assessment ideas into clear requirements, technical solutions and working product features.
	•	System Migration &amp; Architecture: Contributed to the transformation of a PHP monolith into a modern microservices architecture, designing services in both C# .NET Core and Node.js and selecting the optimal runtime for each workload, from lightweight API endpoints to background processing tasks.
	•	CI/CD pipeline optimisation: Maintained and optimised Azure DevOps CI/CD pipelines for SaaS platform delivery, including automated build validation, unit test execution and deployment controls to improve release quality and reduce regression risks across development, staging and production environments.
	•	Accessibility: Ensured WCAG 2.0–2.2 compliance for all the projects
	•	Mentorship: Mentored junior developers in Angular, Node.js and coding best practices, supporting code quality, knowledge sharing and stronger development capability across the team.</Text>
